Adaptation 10-codex-prompt-guidance

Adapt OpenAI's GPT-6.2 prompting guidance for pstack's Codex dispatches and prompt authoring
while preserving each workflow's scope and evidence contract (how/why reference templates were
deleted upstream in pstack 0.15.41).
Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model#prompting-best-practices

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

Rebased to port commit 1ab6b82.

